Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, it's so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.77,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:13.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want,\Ntogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we don't wanna live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.71,0:01:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.75,0:01:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We believe in one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.53,0:01:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bumble, sir, look, it's\Nthe Straw Hat! Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.95,0:01:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.75,0:02:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.47,0:02:25.40,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(734,0)\blur0.6\3c&H181816&\c&H181816&\bord2\1a&HFF&\t(689,734,\1a&H00&)}Unbreakable
Dialogue: 2,0:02:21.47,0:02:25.40,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(734,0)\blur0.6\c&HE5E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Unbreakable
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.75,0:02:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really sick of you\Nguys, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.65,0:02:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.97,0:02:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were getting it our way even\Nbefore we got to this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.31,0:02:34.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not these guys again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.19,0:02:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last time I ran into you, I couldn't\Nfight because I had to protect my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.83,0:02:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, oh, you guys\Nare so going to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.63,0:02:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.95,0:02:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know who you attacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.15,0:02:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no lonely commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.53,0:02:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Wapol, the king and\Nabsolute ruler of Drum Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.71,0:02:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.62,0:02:58.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.54,0:02:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's this country's monarch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.85,0:03:02.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you do such a thing to\Nhis most excellent of excellencies?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.93,0:03:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For shame. Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.93,0:03:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He ticked me off again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.13,0:03:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I take it you've run afoul\Nof Wapol before, young man?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.23,0:03:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure have.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.14,0:03:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's that annoying big-mouthed pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.99,0:03:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.90,0:03:16.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He ate part of our ship, and then\Nhe attacked me and my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's got it coming,\Nand I'm gonna give it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.27,0:03:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kay, but before you do that,\Naren't you cold in that get-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.99,0:03:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.55,0:03:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did he say he was the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.07,0:03:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I thought he was a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.69,0:03:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Took you long enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.99,0:03:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, so you're disrespectful\Nand have wax in your ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.29,0:03:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But yeah, Wapol is the king\Nof Drum Kingdom, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.53,0:03:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he met you before,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.65,0:03:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he was temporarily a pirate for\Nhis own reasons, but no longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.99,0:03:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King Wapple's pirate\Ndays are now behind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.35,0:03:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and so he's returned to reclaim\Nboth his castle and his country.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.73,0:03:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's freezing out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.23,0:03:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.73,0:03:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's 50 below zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.41,0:03:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think they're ignoring us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.29,0:03:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.20,0:04:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, you've got\Nsome nerve. Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.09,0:04:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to bite you into pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.49,0:04:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, sorry, but you'll have\Nto hang on for just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.11,0:04:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had to go get a coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.43,0:04:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.65,0:04:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.59,0:04:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can stretch himself.\NHow? Huh? Oh, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.47,0:04:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because he's a rubber man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.91,0:04:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.65,0:04:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.83,0:04:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.91,0:04:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're up against that old hag,\Na reindeer, and a few of the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that much of a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.33,0:04:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be over quickly, and\Nonce we've eliminated them,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.85,0:04:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there won't be anyone else\Nfoolhardy enough to defy me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, my king.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.29,0:04:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today will be remembered as the day you\Nrestored Drum Kingdom to its former glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.51,0:04:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll start with you, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.91,0:04:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kureha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've committed a major offense\Nby moving into my castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.51,0:04:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and even a greater one by\Nflying that strange flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.67,0:04:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.93,0:04:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not anymore. It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.47,0:04:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.39,0:04:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't interested in this rundown place\Nbut with all the bad things you did here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.95,0:05:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we could use it to\Ndo some good and the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.13,0:05:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reindeer insisted on\Nflying the doctor's flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.77,0:05:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's why I raised\Nthis skull and crossbones
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.77,0:05:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as a challenge to all the\Ndiseases of the world. Skull?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.99,0:05:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This symbolizes my belief\Nthat nothing is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.21,0:05:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will save this country\Nwith my doctor's skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.93,0:05:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By raising this flag, I vowed to\Nfight just like the pirates do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.27,0:05:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, he fought to save this\Ncountry by raising that flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.05,0:05:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you desecrate my castle by\Nflying the flag of that stupid doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.65,0:05:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I command that I be burned immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.07,0:05:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never let you touch that flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.39,0:05:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or get inside this castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.63,0:05:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.83,0:05:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buxer, he's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.35,0:05:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, it is him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.35,0:06:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's that doctor's monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.19,0:06:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one Dalton stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.35,0:06:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That flag there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.69,0:06:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a symbol of his faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.69,0:06:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you take it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.59,0:06:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.69,0:06:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to take it\Nand all of you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.23,0:06:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we're going into the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.07,0:06:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show them no mercy, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old lady, are you going to fight too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.35,0:06:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.39,0:06:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're more than you can\Nhandle, Junior, I'll step in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.27,0:06:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.57,0:06:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.05,0:06:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get them out of your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.43,0:06:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And speaking of hair... Dr. Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.85,0:06:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, big man with the afro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.59,0:06:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't your mother ever tell you\Nit's not right to strike a lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.85,0:06:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially not a hot young one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.23,0:06:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's more like it, Blondie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.99,0:06:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.43,0:06:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.65,0:06:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.56,0:06:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't this stupid thing come off?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:06:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's making it stick to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.61,0:07:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Static electricity or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.01,0:07:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactamundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.47,0:07:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.38,0:07:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off my leg, you disgusting hairball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.17,0:07:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cold, I need a coat really\Nquick, any coat will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.51,0:07:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.91,0:07:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard a lot of noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's freezing out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.21,0:07:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seen any coats around?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.61,0:07:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.97,0:07:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I want to know is\Nwhat's happening out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.45,0:07:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.75,0:07:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, do you guys need help?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.67,0:07:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, stay in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.17,0:07:33.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you need a coat, you can borrow mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.41,0:07:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.32,0:07:35.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's a girl's coat and it's ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.73,0:07:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you did say any coat will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.69,0:07:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.60,0:07:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, as long as it keeps me warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.65,0:07:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, I wonder what all the fuss was about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.81,0:07:49.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Big Mouth, now I\Ncan finally kick your butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.03,0:07:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear I'm gonna smack\Nthat hair of all guys silly
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.75,0:07:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whenever I finally get\Nthis nasty thing off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.15,0:08:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.71,0:08:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monomo statically!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.49,0:08:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.41,0:08:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great Deer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.59,0:08:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.49,0:08:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.87,0:08:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get these things off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.81,0:08:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.23,0:08:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.15,0:08:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.35,0:08:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you? You keep them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.89,0:08:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you two please\Nstop goofing around? Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.63,0:08:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a reason I don't\Nkeep my hair conditioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.89,0:08:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a very good one at that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.93,0:08:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their dryness makes them\Nburst into flames much easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.45,0:08:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.39,0:08:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna burn these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.87,0:08:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.03,0:08:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.94,0:08:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.86,0:08:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Decoy plan! Decoy plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.95,0:08:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm the decoy? Check it, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.03,0:08:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.94,0:08:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.03,0:09:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.35,0:09:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This might be a girl's\Ncoat, but it's really warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.13,0:09:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, grab my leg from there! Leg? Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.97,0:09:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.11,0:09:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, just don't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.37,0:09:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armageddon in an air assault!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.37,0:09:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.93,0:09:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not too shabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.63,0:09:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, thanks, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.47,0:09:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are so amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.95,0:09:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.78,0:09:53.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Nami's coat\Nyou're wearing, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.95,0:09:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Big Mouth's still alive, but\Nhis hippo's headed to the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.05,0:09:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it off right now, jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.93,0:10:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol, sir, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.41,0:10:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've underestimated them\Nthey're stronger than
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we thought then it's\Ntime to bring out my big
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.97,0:10:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guns and my bigger\Nappetite huh i'll show them
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.65,0:10:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the true power the much\Nmuch fruit very good sir
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.79,0:10:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's right i'll show\Nthem the much much factory
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.05,0:10:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh he stood up yeah but\Nhow you hit him pretty
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.95,0:10:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.86,0:10:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess he's tough? Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.21,0:10:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.31,0:10:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 20 MDs?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.17,0:10:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He will be if we don't act soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.11,0:10:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.03,0:10:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has severe frostbite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.43,0:10:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can begin treating him\Nimmediately if you'll let us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.17,0:10:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are doctors here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.47,0:10:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I heard there weren't\Nany sawbones in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.77,0:10:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are a few doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.23,0:10:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys are the 20 MDs,\Nbut they work exclusively for
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.95,0:10:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol, so that makes them bad doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.67,0:10:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.58,0:10:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't trust any of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.17,0:11:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Traitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.08,0:11:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You expect us to leave Dalton with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You surrendered to Wapol without\Na fight and turned your backs
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.63,0:11:05.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.54,0:11:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol probably sent you\Nhere to kill Dalton!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.37,0:11:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, if you want to save him, just do
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.11,0:11:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.02,0:11:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 20 of us are still doctors,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.15,0:11:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though we were forced\Nagainst our wills to serve Only
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.99,0:11:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waffle. We've always worked to\Nadvance our medical research.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.83,0:11:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for the benefit of all the\Npatients in this country it was
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all because of a certain quack\Nwho taught us never to give up
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.69,0:11:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can't afford to lose any more\Nmen like him so please let us help
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.55,0:11:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hs tell me what i ate today and\Nin the exact order that i ate it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.35,0:11:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, sir, you started by\Neating two cannons on the ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one sautéed in butter and the other raw.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.35,0:11:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it was a cannonball\Nand gunpowder salad,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.49,0:11:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,followed by the main course\Nof a toasted cottage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.15,0:11:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you thought I ate a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.73,0:11:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do, but this guy's\Na bigger pig than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.07,0:12:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.79,0:12:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever I eat becomes part of my\Nbody thanks to the munch-munch fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.39,0:12:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Much, much shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.05,0:12:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Wapol House!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.81,0:12:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A house?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.77,0:12:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.57,0:12:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll please\Nexcuse me, I have to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.35,0:12:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold the Much, Much Factory!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.37,0:12:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.01,0:12:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's eating his own men!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.43,0:12:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.85,0:12:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feast your eyes on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.63,0:13:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come forth, you miraculous union!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.17,0:13:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of union?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.31,0:13:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.65,0:13:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the strongest\Nwarrior of Drum Kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.09,0:13:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chesmarimo! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miraculous Union?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.81,0:13:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More like Ridiculous Union.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.77,0:13:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.33,0:13:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.21,0:13:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.51,0:13:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.49,0:13:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They might look silly,\Nbut don't be fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.69,0:13:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.60,0:13:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tough that the citizens\Ncouldn't stand against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.29,0:13:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how these thugs were\Nable to exile all the doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.45,0:13:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Article 1 of the Drum\NKingdom's constitution.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.25,0:13:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who don't do as the king\Nwishes will be put to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.31,0:13:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the number one law of this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.23,0:13:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You refused my wishes and broke that law.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.13,0:13:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you are all going to be\Npunished for your crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.25,0:13:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first I'm going to\Ndeal with the matter
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.97,0:14:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that quacks flack\Nsullying my regal castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.45,0:14:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,IT'S TIME I TOOK THAT THING DOWN!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.99,0:14:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pirate flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.15,0:14:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey reindeer, that flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.59,0:14:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing is impossible for a\Nman who raises the pirate flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.59,0:14:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that what I told you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.81,0:14:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.55,0:14:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You attacked Doctor's flag, you freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.99,0:14:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor tried to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.51,0:14:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He tried to save even you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.49,0:14:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.73,0:14:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,try not to hold a grudge\Nagainst us humans, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.23,0:15:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This country is sick right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.89,0:15:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is Walpole, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.33,0:15:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone as bad as him\Nisn't worth saving, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.95,0:15:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.57,0:15:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.59,0:15:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't hurt you if you just\Nleave this country forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.47,0:15:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.05,0:15:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he does promise that, you\Ncan't trust a word that desperate says!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.27,0:15:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.11,0:15:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor said... Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.29,0:15:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.07,0:15:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Big Mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.95,0:15:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.89,0:15:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys weren't real pirates, you\Nwere just fake ones, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.37,0:15:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you don't know what\Nflying a pirate flag means!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.13,0:15:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause you were just a bunch of\Nfakes who didn't risk your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.43,0:15:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.73,0:16:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.59,0:16:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go up the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.89,0:16:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Usopp? Mr. Bushido?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.17,0:16:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sitting around and\Nwaiting is killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.63,0:16:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy and the others could have\Ngotten hurt in that avalanche.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.73,0:16:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They might be trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.75,0:16:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't forget, Nami had a high fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.05,0:16:14.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything's happened to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.37,0:16:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're worried about Nami, and Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.87,0:16:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Sanji, and Dalton, and\Nwhat's going on in Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.33,0:16:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, can't you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.93,0:16:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're carrying too many\Nburdens on your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.03,0:16:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.67,0:16:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't need to go up there\Nat all, and do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.27,0:16:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because those three are fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.05,0:16:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's Luffy and Nami and\NSaint you were talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.93,0:16:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.71,0:16:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right. He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.31,0:16:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to have faith in your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.89,0:16:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp does, and that's\Nwhy he can be so calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.63,0:16:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.65,0:16:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.65,0:16:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're full of wisdom, Lusol.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.47,0:16:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he's full of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.75,0:16:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just afraid to go up that mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.49,0:16:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.40,0:17:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I heard that there were things like\Nyetis and huge man-eating bunnies up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.09,0:17:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna get eaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.17,0:17:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then say so from the start, coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.39,0:17:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.30,0:17:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna be some monster\Nsnack, and I'm sure they're fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.15,0:17:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy can work out anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.49,0:17:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton, no! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.21,0:17:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! It's Dalton! Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.95,0:17:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would somebody please\Ntell me who this guy is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.47,0:17:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton, listen to reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.05,0:17:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.97,0:17:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let Wapol retake the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.93,0:17:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.27,0:17:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean that's where you're heading?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.43,0:17:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The castle in your condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.09,0:17:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.31,0:17:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My country is far more\Nimportant than my health!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.35,0:17:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He cannot succeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.29,0:17:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not let that happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.79,0:17:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.70,0:17:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.62,0:17:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol must perish!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.53,0:17:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're not strong enough to\Nfight them in your condition, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.77,0:17:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the rest of us are\Nno match for them either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.29,0:17:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to settle this\Nthing once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.73,0:17:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stop Wapol even if it kills me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.83,0:18:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, I'll take you to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.77,0:18:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hop on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.85,0:18:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on now, don't be so modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.81,0:18:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want you to save your\Nstrength for the fight, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.29,0:18:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hold tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.27,0:18:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, here it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.57,0:18:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be there in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.09,0:18:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp meant well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.33,0:18:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, thanks, but this isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.53,0:18:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me a second, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.61,0:18:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't quite hit my stride yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.21,0:18:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I told you I was going to\Nget you to the castle and I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.81,0:18:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I caught my breath here,\Nwe can get back on our very way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.09,0:18:59.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, what the hell is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.81,0:19:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just going to sit there and\Nwhine or are you coming with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.29,0:19:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.65,0:19:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stupid jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.09,0:19:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You thunder stealer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.79,0:19:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.43,0:19:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.07,0:19:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as I was getting my\Nsecond wind, too. I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.19,0:19:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure you were. I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.65,0:19:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what to shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.69,0:19:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick you. Hey, wait. Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.67,0:19:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's an easier way\Nup to the castle. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.47,0:19:32.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of walking, take the\Nropeway. Ropeway? Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.19,0:19:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There hasn't been one connecting\Nto Wackel's castle for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.57,0:19:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's obviously reconnected\None because I just saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.51,0:19:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a rope leading\Nfrom the castle to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.53,0:19:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a big white tree on the\Noutskirts of Gyasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.27,0:19:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gyasta, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.33,0:19:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the name of the town that Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.97,0:19:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kureha was headed to, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pirate flag means, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.81,0:19:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.35,0:19:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flags have no meaning!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.07,0:19:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think that, you're\Ndumber than you look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.53,0:20:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.19,0:20:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.10,0:20:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirate flags stand for\Nsomething, Big Mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.77,0:20:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not raised to some kind of joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.91,0:20:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.82,0:20:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only joke is that I've let\Nyou live as long as I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.07,0:20:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you dared put that flag back,\Nit's time I delivered the punchline!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.51,0:20:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, take your best shot, Big Mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.09,0:20:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't break this flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.97,0:20:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The skull on it is a symbol of fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.43,0:20:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey you, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.47,0:20:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.45,0:20:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a direct hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.07,0:20:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He and that flag were blown to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.77,0:20:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Told you. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.05,0:20:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:20:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.88,0:21:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.15,0:21:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea who this pirate flag\Noriginally belonged to, but it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.09,0:21:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pirate flag is someone's\Npledge to risk their life!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.45,0:21:12.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not something to be shot\Nat or made fun of, jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.75,0:21:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It stands for something that you\Nstupid jackasses will never understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.77,0:21:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not in a million years!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.89,0:21:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.13,0:21:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.07,0:21:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.55,0:21:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're dashing swashbucklers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.33,0:21:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's great to be a pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.41,0:21:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most amazing people sail the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.21,0:21:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, someday you've got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.95,0:21:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, reindeer! Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.87,0:21:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick these guys' butts for showing\Nyour friend's flag disrespect, you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.53,0:21:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.83,0:21:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.31,0:21:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.25,0:22:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright then, since you feel\Nso strongly about that flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.11,0:22:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy you along with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.25,0:22:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so, tubby.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.49,0:22:12.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like your backbone gave out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.21,0:22:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your condition will continue\Nto worsen if you keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.65,0:22:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.19,0:22:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor's order!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.23,0:22:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you two want to fight amongst yourselves,\Nthen please, by all means, do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.21,0:22:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I hope you'll at least watch your\Nfriend in that flag get blown to bits!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.79,0:22:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.70,0:22:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say your prayers!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.17,0:22:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.37,0:22:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.03,0:22:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get him, reindeer guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.01,0:22:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waffle, sir, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.09,0:22:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.23,0:23:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The little furball's got more\Ncourage than a full-grown man
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.39,0:23:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry Frank, but there's no way I'm\Ngonna let you lay a single paw on our king
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.29,0:23:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow there really are some strange\Ncreatures in this world You must be that
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.13,0:23:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeti the villagers hated and feared they\Ntried to kill you and chased you away,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.07,0:23:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.98,0:23:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you spent your whole\Nlife all alone with no friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.23,0:23:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a monster. Nobody likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.41,0:23:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People want to kill you, but here\Nyou are trying to save this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.87,0:23:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the stupidest\Nthing I've ever heard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.95,0:23:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.86,0:23:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I don't have friends, I can\Nstand by for something I believe in!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.97,0:23:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as long as the flag\Nflies, I will! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.69,0:23:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.33,0:23:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.85,0:23:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do have friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.53,0:23:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm your friend, reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.49,0:23:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.89,0:24:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.29,0:24:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be flat as a pancake!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.39,0:24:14.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I'm fine,\Nbecause I'm a rubber man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.57,0:24:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rubber?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.69,0:24:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, reindeer, can you finish\Noff that two-headed guy for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.45,0:24:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That one over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.77,0:24:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.09,0:24:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good. While you're doing\Nthat, I'll take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.23,0:24:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.55,0:24:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dare to knock me, this\Ncountry's monarch, over?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.47,0:24:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for that insult!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.57,0:24:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm taking you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.65,0:24:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so, you and what army?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.45,0:24:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, you little freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.65,0:24:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freak, that's like the pot\Ncalling the kettle black.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.19,0:24:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you keep moving around, you\Nmay lose the ability to walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.59,0:24:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so just stay down there and shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.73,0:24:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't worry, when push comes to\Nshove, my reindeer can hold his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.45,0:25:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.45,0:25:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Tony Tony Chopper, not Freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.97,0:25:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a name the world's\Ngreatest doctor gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.33,0:25:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a wonderful man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.27,0:25:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he forgave you for disrespecting\Nhis flag, I won't forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.45,0:25:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only one who will\Nshow no forgiveness is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.45,0:25:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stomp you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.03,0:25:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rumble Ball!

